{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27803","headline":"奉和大梁相公重九日军中宴会之什 · 裴夷直","name":"奉和大梁相公重九日军中宴会之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今古同嘉节，欢娱但异名。\n陶公缘绿醑，谢傅爲苍生。\n酒泛金英丽，诗通玉律清。\n何言辞物累，方系万人情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴夷直","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}